    <string name="free_books_form_help">{name} inserts a variable URL-encoded, {+name} as is. Search knows {query}, {title}, {author}, {titleWords}, {surname}, {language}, {language3}, {languageName}, {isbn} and {isbns}; each rule adds its name. A search with {isbn} tries the book\'s ISBNs one by one and keeps every result. Rules run CSS, then JSON path, then attribute, then regex (first group); XML pages parse as XML. Rules named size (bytes) and format describe the file, skip drops the item. Relative links resolve against the previous page.</string>
    <string name="free_books_test">Test</string>
    <string name="free_books_test_hint">Searches, runs every step for the first item and opens the file without downloading it. Debug test also logs headers, pages and every item, then saves the log; header values are hidden, check URLs before sharing.</string>
